      "reason": "Checked extended-real values on the exact common domain, m=p=0, vacuous rank and multiplier conventions, finite-gap qualification and relative-interior strict feasibility. The least-original-index deletion rule is deterministic and every deletion preserves D and feasibility; no optimizer existence follows by definition. The carrier is sound and unchanged; added its missing current Alpha risk_review to the batch contract.",
