      "reason": "The stage, endpoint and quadrature equations use matching coefficients and cell-constant controls. Time/state/control memberships precede every f/L query, including implicit trial stages; the lower-triangular branch uses only the supplier recursion, avoiding its open-time-domain restriction at t=0. Internal stage elimination is an explicit local convention, and existence/order are unclaimed. Added the missing Alpha risk_review; the carrier remains unchanged.",
